OL,3,ADaniel Thomas pleads not guilty after
OL,4,Adinghy slashed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty to both charges
OL,7,Fand was remanded in custody until his
OL,8,Fnext court appearance at Portsmouth
OL,9,FCrown Court on 29 September.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
