OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump and Xi exchange warm words at
OL,4,Astate dinner but little progress on key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut tensions remain despite the
OL,8,Fdiplomatic niceties, including over
OL,9,FTaiwan - with Xi urging Trump earlier
OL,10,Fin the day to take the "correct
OL,11,Fposition" on the self-governing island
OL,12,Fwhich Beijing claims, amid a weapons
OL,13,Fpackage paused by Trump.
OL,15,FBillionaire business leaders and US
OL,16,Ftech CEOs joined the leaders at the
OL,17,Fextravagant dinner late on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
